🚽 Regression for issue 246: statements after `bussin` in skibidi main do not
🚽 run -- `bussin` unwinds out of main. Only "before" prints; "after" must not.
🚽 (Uses bussin 0 so this can assert on stdout; the nonzero exit-status path is
🚽 pinned by bussin_main_exit_code and bussin_main_edgy_exit.)
skibidi main {
    yapping("before");
    bussin 0;
    yapping("after");
}
